{"id":96,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Iq'ra bi-is'mi rabbika alladhī khalaq","translation":"Read, ˹O Prophet,˺ in the Name of your Lord Who created—"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","transliteration":"Khalaqa l-insāna min ʿalaqin","translation":"created humans from a clinging clot"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","transliteration":"Iq'ra warabbuka l-akram","translation":"Read! And your Lord is the Most Generous"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","transliteration":"Alladhī ʿallama bil-qalam","translation":"Who taught by the pen—"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","transliteration":"ʿallama l-insāna mā lam yaʿlam","translation":"taught humanity what they knew not"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Kallā inna l-insāna layaṭghā","translation":"Most certainly, one exceeds all bounds"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ar-raāhu is'taghnā","translation":"once they think they are self-sufficient"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Inna ilā rabbika r-ruj'ʿā","translation":"˹But˺ surely to your Lord is the return ˹of all˺"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta alladhī yanhā","translation":"Have you seen the man who prevents"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿabdan idhā ṣallā","translation":"a servant ˹of Ours˺ from praying"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta in kāna ʿalā l-hudā","translation":"What if this ˹servant˺ is ˹rightly˺ guided"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw amara bil-taqwā","translation":"or encourages righteousness"},{"number":13,"arabicText":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Ara-ayta in kadhaba watawallā","translation":"What if that ˹man˺ persists in denial and turns away"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yaʿlam bi-anna l-laha yarā","translation":"Does he not know that Allah sees ˹all˺"},{"number":15,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","transliteration":"Kallā la-il-lam yantahi lanasfaʿan bil-nāṣiyat","translation":"But no! If he does not desist, We will certainly drag him by the forelock—"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Nāṣiyatin kādhibatin khāṭi-atin","translation":"a lying, sinful forelock"},{"number":17,"arabicText":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"Falyadʿu nādiyah","translation":"So let him call his associates"},{"number":18,"arabicText":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","transliteration":"Sanadʿu z-zabāniyat","translation":"We will call the wardens of Hell"},{"number":19,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","transliteration":"Kallā lā tuṭiʿ'hu wa-us'jud wa-iq'tarib","translation":"Again, no! Never obey him ˹O Prophet˺! Rather, ˹continue to˺ prostrate and draw near ˹to Allah˺"}]}